commit 23f8c73fe29341d4f34c84a80bfa01bb1696b56f

C03: weather and news lookups reach the read-only search; irrelevant results are a failure statement; temporal tokens are search stop words (WEB1269 repair)

WEB1267: «busca el clima en Buenos Aires» and «qué clima hace en Buenos
Aires» never reached web.search (the live-lookup reader accepted no search
or question head) and the model planner declared them out of catalog;
«noticias de deportes de hoy» failed as irrelevant because every result had
to contain «hoy», and «today's news» matched the TV show TODAY; the failure
message «the results were irrelevant» was rejected as missing_failure until
the retries ran out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


